ed97caa5b3c029e","start":0,"end":66,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-f7fda9ffe8bc41d77f7c","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-81c68d45854a46d816ed","layer":"original","quote":"劭同时东海缪袭亦有才学〖1〗，多所述叙；官至尚书、光禄勋。","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":400,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":29,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-0ea5417fe583b862f008","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-48f8b0c1357b75285720","layer":"original","quote":"临当大会，乃遣散骑常侍缪袭〖1〗，奉诏喻指曰〖2〗：“朕新莅庶事，一日万机。惧听断之不明，赖有德之臣，左右朕躬；而君屡以疾辞位。夫量主择君，不居其朝；委荣弃禄，不究其位〖3〗；古人固有之矣，顾以为周公、伊尹则不然〖4〗。洁身徇节〖5〗，常人为之，不望之于君。君其力疾就会，以惠予一人。将立席几筵，命百官总己〖6〗；以须君到，朕然后御坐。”又诏袭：“须歆必起，乃还。”歆不得已，乃起。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":193,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":47,"end":238,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
